{"Title":"An Act relative to state grants targeting minority communities","BillNumber":"H411","DocketNumber":"HD3019","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"C_G1","Name":"Carlos González","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_G1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:03:16.14"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"C_G1","Name":"Carlos González","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_G1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:03:16.14"},{"Id":"MMD1","Name":"Michelle M. DuBois","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-07T20:56:53.5933333"},{"Id":"O_R1","Name":"Orlando Ramos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/O_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-13T15:10:17.1066667"},{"Id":"BLW1","Name":"Bud L. Williams","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BLW1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T13:17:14.23"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H411/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative González of Springfield, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 411) of Carlos González and others that certain state grants target minority communities and businesses.  Economic Development and Emerging Technologies.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Subsection (p) of section 3 of Chapter 40G is hereby amended by adding the following:-  \r\n\t; provided, further, that not less than 30 per cent of recipients be minority-owned businesses or businesses with boards composed of not less than 50 per cent minority members. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Subsection (29) of Section 3 of Chapter 23G is hereby amended by adding the following:- \r\n\t; provided, further, that not less than 30 per cent of recipients be minority-owned businesses or businesses with boards composed of not less than 50 per cent minority members. \r\n\tSECTION 3. Subsection (22) of Section 4 of Chapter 23I is hereby amended by adding the following:- \r\n\t; provided, further, that not less than 30 per cent of recipients be minority-owned businesses or businesses with boards composed of not less than 50 per cent minority members. \r\n\tSECTION 4. Subsection (t) of Section 3 of Chapter 40W is hereby amended by adding the following:-  \r\n\t; provided, further, that not less than 30 per cent of recipients be minority-owned businesses or businesses with boards composed of not less than 50 per cent minority members. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J12","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J12"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}